				(thickness 0.135)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "B top: J1 IOB-HS1 MCIO124 (CB J3), J2 display link MCIO74 (Face P). B bottom: stock PSU DC 12P + signal 6P (pinouts UNCONFIRMED), J5 Micro-Fit -> BP J2, J6 IOB-LINK."
